  "description": "Seeking freedom from the stifling life of the Dragon Palace, the Dragon King escapes to the surface and begins living as a humble boatman on the waters of Indangsu, enjoying the simple pleasures of a life without duties. But with the Dragon King gone, the currents of Indangsu grow dangerously wild. Fearing the raging waters, the villagers decide to calm the sea with a human sacrifice, choosing Sim Cheong as the offering. Before she is cast into the sea, Sim Cheong makes one final wish. And that wish brings her face to face with the runaway Dragon King.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Jeollaeyahandonghwa (전래야한동화) Collection.*",
